.SH NAME
gf-group-attribute-sync-create-group-mappings - Creates mappings for a group this endpoint is behind the feature flag group attribute sync and is considered


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgf group-attribute-sync create-group-mappings [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates mappings for a group this endpoint is behind the feature flag group attribute sync and is considered experimental

.PP
Body schema (GroupAttributes):
  roles  array

.PP
Response schema (CreateGroupMappingsCreated.Payload):
  message  string


